						</strong></p><p class="mb-2"><strong>In July 2013, the studio was established.</strong></p><p class="mb-2"><strong>In December 2014, Dongguan Chengpai Network Technology Co., Ltd. (东莞市橙派网络科技有限公司)was founded.
						</strong></p><p class="mb-2"><strong>In 2018, it was awarded the title of Dongguan High-tech Enterprise.
						</strong></p><p class="mb-2"><strong>In November 2023, it won the honor of being among the first batch of partners of 1688 cross-border e-commerce.
						</strong></p><p class="mb-2"><strong>In December 2023 AiPrice became the Official Cross-border Service Provider of 1688.
						</strong></p><p class="mb-3"><strong>In August 2025, AiPrice was awarded as the 2025 New Power Partner by WorldFirst.
						</strong></p><p class="mb-3"><strong>In February 2026, the AliPrice brand was officially upgraded to AiPrice.
						</strong></p><p class="">As of August 2025, AiPrice has 1 million total users, with nearly 650,000 registered.Its website ranks around 20,000 globally on Alexa, and around 1,000 in South Korea.Over 70% of Korean merchants use the AiPrice plugin, demonstrating its influence and popularity in the international market.
						</p><!-- <p>Like us? Follow us on <a target="_blank" href="https://www.facebook.com/official.aiprice" rel="nofollow">Facebook</a>, <a target="_blank" href="http://vk.com/aiprice" rel="nofollow">VK</a>.</p> --></div></div></div></div></div></div><!-- about end --></div><!-- main end --><div class="footer"><div class="footer-container d-flex justify-content-between"><div class="ft-left"><div class="ft-logo-new"><img class="ft-logo-img mb-3" src="https://cn01.aiprice.com/static/index/img/footer-logo.png" height="30" alt="AliPrice logo"></div><ul class="ft-list-group"><li class="ft-list-item"><p>Copyright © AiPrice.com – All Rights Reserved</p></li><!-- <li class="ft-list-item"><a class="ft-list-link" href="https://www.aiprice.com/information/index/page/help" target="_blank">How to use?</a></li> --><li class="ft-list-item"><p>Service: Working day 09:00-18:30</p></li><li class="ft-list-item"><p>Beijing CST &nbsp; <span id="beijing_time_footer">2026-10-07 07:12:35</span></p></li><li class="ft-list-item"><p>AiPrice is an independent third-party tool and is not affiliated with the Alibaba Group.</p></li></ul></div><div class="ft-info"><h3 class="ft-title">Information</h3><ul class="ft-list-group"><li class="ft-list-item"><a class="ft-list-link" href="https://www.aiprice.com/information/index/page/about" target="_blank">About Us</a></li><li class="ft-list-item"><a class="ft-list-link" href="https://www.aiprice.com/information/index/page/contact?from=www_footer" target="_blank">Contact Us</a></li><li class="ft-list-item"><a class="ft-list-link" href="https://www.aiprice.com/information/index/page/term_of_use" target="_blank">Terms of Use</a></li><li class="ft-list-item"><a class="ft-list-link" href="https://www.aiprice.com/information/index/page/privacy" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a></li><li class="ft-list-item"><a class="ft-list-link" href="https://www.aiprice.com/information/index/page/helps" target="_blank">Help</a></li><li class="ft-list-item"><a class="ft-list